  "_comment": "Kata 4.4.0 (kata-static-4.4.0-amd64 with the nvidia-gpu kernel and rootfs images) on oke-us-phx-1-cc-prod, runtime-rs configuration-qemu-nvidia-gpu-tdx-runtime-rs.toml plus fixtures/kata-tdx/config.d. Registers come from Trustee claims of pods with one, two and four B200s, from the CCEL of a small one-GPU probe pod (3 vCPUs, 4.5 GiB), and from the TD quotes and CCELs of seven probe pods sized to cover 0 to 4 GPUs, 2 to 151 vCPUs and 2.5 GiB to 2 TiB, with vcpus and memory_mib read from each guest's SMBIOS tables; events are single digests from the same boots, so each input is pinned and not only the folded register. vcpus and memory_mib are what Kata passed QEMU.",
